  "prefLabel": "Gen 502.02 Modifications of the NSGC Code of Ethics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 502.02 Modifications of the NSGC Code of Ethics. Modifications to the NSGC code of ethics shall be as follows:\n\n(a) The exclusion of the preamble to the NSGC code of ethics;\n\n(b) The deletion of “work to” at the end of the first paragraph in Section I, II, and III and replacing with “shall”; and\n\n(c) The deletion of Section IV: Genetic Counselors and Society.\n\nSource. #10666, eff 9-10-14; ss by #13502, eff 12-10-22\n\nAppendix A\n\nAppendix B\n\nRule | Title | Obtain at:\n\nGen 501 and Gen 502 | Ethical Standards | National Society of Genetic Counselors Executive Office 330 North Wabash Avenue, Suite 2000 Chicago, Illinois 60611 (312) 321-6834 Free online at: https://www.nsgc.org/Policy-Research-and-Publications/Code-of-Ethics-Conflict-of-Interest/Code-of-Ethics",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen500.html"
